      "finding": "R1-F1",
      "reason": "The start of the next run belongs to the loop or the scheduler. The plan now promises only that the window ends at the day end, says so in the goal and the non-goals, and the acceptance reads the log for that and for a fetch after midnight, not for the time a run starts."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-19T23:58:04Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R2-F1",
      "reason": "Checked: a closed sqlite connection raises ProgrammingError, not KbError. The boundary is now KbError or sqlite3.Error for the short window and anything else propagates, with tests for a closed, a locked and an unexpected error, and breaks that widen or narrow the catch."
    },
    {
      "at": "2026-11-19T23:58:46Z",
      "choice": "applied",
      "earlier": [],
      "finding": "R3-F1",
      "reason": "The end of the day is a cooperative deadline like the others of the window: no new call starts after it and a call in flight may finish. The goal, criteria 4 and 6 and the acceptance say so, and a test lets a call cross midnight and shows that no later call begins."
    }
